lit_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருவிதுப்பு","parts":[{"text":"பெருவிதுப்பு","lemma":"பெருவிதுப்பு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உறுக","parts":[{"text":"உறுக","lemma":"உறுக","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வேந்தே_","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தே_","lemma":"வேந்தே_","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கொன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"கொன்","lemma":"கொன்","gloss":"uselessly"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even in vain"},{"surface":"சாதல்","parts":[{"text":"சா","lemma":"சா","gloss":"to die"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"dying"},{"surface":"வெய்யோற்கு","parts":[{"text":"வெய்யோன்","lemma":"வெய்யோன்","gloss":"one who desires"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to him who desires"},{"surface":"தன்தலை","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தன்","gloss":"his"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"his own head"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மணிமருள்","parts":[{"text":"மணி","lemma":"மணி","gloss":"sapphire"},{"text":"மருள்","lemma":"மருள்","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"sapphire-resembling"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"சூட்டி","parts":[{"text":"சூட்டு","lemma":"சூட்டு","gloss":"to adorn"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having adorned"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"head"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருகாழ்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"single"},{"text":"காழ்","lemma":"காழ்","gloss":"strand"}],"gloss":"single-strand"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"himself"}],"gloss":"himself"},{"surface":"மலைந்தனனே","parts":[{"text":"மலைந்தனனே","lemma":"மலைந்தனனே","gloss":"he wore"}],"gloss":"he wore","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Young boys, drummers, singing children, / approaching the dark youth in pure white cloth, / ward off the clamor of dark birds! I too, / with the whirling of the wailing tune, will drive away the white jackals. / May the king experience great distress like me! / To him who desires dying even in vain, / having adorned his head with a sapphire-resembling garland, / he himself wore a single-strand garland on his head.","translation":"O young boys, drummers, and singing children! Approach the dark youth wrapped in pure white cloth, and ward off the clamorous dark birds. I, too, will drive away the white jackals by singing a wailing tune as I whirl around. May the king suffer great distress like me! For this youth, who desired death even in a useless cause, adorned his leader's head with a sapphire-like garland, and wore only a single-strand garland on his own head.","modern":"துடி கொட்டும் சிறுவர்களே, பாடும் பிள்ளைகளே! தூய வெண்ணிற ஆடை போர்த்தப்பட்டிருக்கும் அந்தக் கரிய இளைஞனை நெருங்கி, கரிய பறவைகளின் ஆரவாரத்தைத் தடுத்து விரட்டுங்கள். நானும் விளரிப் பண்ணைப் பாடிச் சுழன்று, வெண்மையான நரிகளை விரட்டுவேன். என்னைப் போலவே அந்தப் பகை வேந்தனும் பெருந்துன்பத்தை அடையட்டும்! வீணாகச் சாவதையும் விரும்பிய இந்த வீரன், தன் தலைவனுடைய தலையில் நீலமணி போன்ற மாலையைச் சூட்டிவிட்டு, தன் தலையில் ஒரு சரமுடைய மாலையைத் தானே சூடிக்கொண்டு போர்க்களத்தில் வீழ்ந்தானே!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Karantai tiṇai (cattle recovery / defensive warfare). A mother or female relative is mourning a young warrior who has fallen on the battlefield. She calls upon the young drummers and singing children to guard his body, wrapped in a white shroud, from predatory birds. She promises to join them, singing the mournful viḷari tune to ward off the jackals. She curses the enemy king to suffer the same agonizing grief she feels. She recalls her son's selfless loyalty: he crowned his leader with a beautiful sapphire-like garland, while humbly wearing only a single-strand garland himself before charging into battle.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}